{
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
      "label": "Prometheus (Grafana Cloud)",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "prometheus"
    }
  ],
  "title": "Ladini — LLM (Gateway + coûts)",
  "uid": "ladini-llm",
  "description": "Vision agrégée des appels LLM (modèle/statut/latence/coût/fallback) — complète Langfuse, ne le duplique pas (pas de prompt/réponse ici).",
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "tags": [
    "ladini",
    "hetzner"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "30s",
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "⚠ Gap connu — lire avant de faire confiance à ce dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Toutes les métriques ci-dessous (`ladini_llm_*`, `ladini_legacy_fallback_total`) sont enregistrées **dans le process `worker`** (c'est le worker Celery qui exécute le graphe LangGraph et appelle le LLM Gateway — `record_generation()` tourne côté worker, pas côté `api`). Le service `worker` n'a **aucun serveur HTTP** et n'expose donc PAS `/metrics` aujourd'hui — voir `infra/alloy/README.md` §\"gap connu\". Ce dashboard reste vide en production tant que ce gap n'est pas comblé (mode `prometheus_client` multiprocess, ou serveur de métriques dédié dans le worker — non implémenté ici, travail futur documenté). Noms de métriques et labels EXACTS repris de `backend/src/ladini/core/telemetry.py` — aucune métrique inventée."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Appels LLM / min, par modèle et statut",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(ladini_llm_calls_total[5m])) by (model, status) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}} {{status}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latence LLM p50 / p95 (par modèle)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(ladini_llm_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le, model))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 {{model}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(ladini_llm_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le, model))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{model}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tokens LLM consommés / min (prompt vs completion)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(ladini_llm_tokens_total[5m])) by (model, kind) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}} {{kind}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Coût LLM estimé (USD/h, par famille de prompt)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(ladini_llm_cost_usd_total[1h])) by (prompt_family) * 3600",
          "legendFormat": "{{prompt_family}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Bascules de repli LLM Gateway (fallback)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(ladini_llm_fallback_total[15m])) by (profile, provider, reason) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{profile}}/{{provider}} ({{reason}})",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Ouvertures du disjoncteur LLM (circuit open)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(ladini_llm_circuit_open_total[1h])) by (provider, model)",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}}/{{model}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Replis vers l'interpréteur legacy (objectif : tendre vers 0)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 29,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(ladini_legacy_fallback_total[15m])) by (prompt_family) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{prompt_family}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    }
  ]
}